{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38390","headline":"灵宝县西侧津 · 吴融","name":"灵宝县西侧津","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧溪潋潋流残阳，晴沙两两眠鸳鸯。\n柳花无赖苦多暇，蛱蝶有情长自忙。\n千里宦游成底事，每年风景是他乡。\n高歌一曲垂鞭去，尽日无人识楚狂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}